{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Mass.Lever1TauClosedForm","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1TauClosedForm","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Mass.Lever1Tau.tau_kernel_closed_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Mass.Lever1Tau.tau_kernel_closed_form","kind":"theorem","line":36,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Mass/Lever1TauClosedForm.lean#L36-L46","doc":"**Closed form for the depth-2 binding-kernel trace.** Given the three production-wired anchors\n`a_D^(2)=1`, `a_D^(3)=(q+1)²/(3q)`, `a_D^(4)=(3q²+4+3q⁻²)/4`, the seed trace\n`τ = (a_D^(2)+a_D^(4))/a_D^(3)` equals the cubic-over-quadratic rational `3(3q⁴+8q²+3)/(4q(q+1)²)`.\nExact field identity for `q ≠ 0`, `q + 1 ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}